lagfinder.tip.methods_sort=Sorting\nBy load: the time of the method with all it calls.\nBy own time: the time of the method's own code only - finds the hot loops.\nBy mod: lines grouped by the mod of their class.
lagfinder.tip.tree=From the thread's start down to the methods doing the work: each line with all it calls under it. Open the hottest path to go straight to where the time goes.
lagfinder.tip.hot=Methods by the time of their own code, wherever they were called from. Click a picked method again to see it in the tree.
lagfinder.tip.blame=A sample is put down to the mod whose code is nearest the top of the stack: what a mod calls in the game or in Java is that mod's time. Minecraft, Forge and Java get only what no mod asked for.
lagfinder.tip.all_mods=Show the whole tree
