lagfinder.tip.unpick_mod=Click to show all mods again
lagfinder.tip.method_share=Share\nThe part of all the sampled working time.
lagfinder.tip.method_total=Time a tick (or frame)\nThe method with everything it calls, on average.
lagfinder.tip.method_self=Own time\nThe method's own code only, without what it calls.
lagfinder.tip.reveal_tree=Click again to show it in the tree

